OL,3,GNEWSAMan to stand trial over murder of
OL,4,Awoman in 1994
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is to stand trial over the murder
OL,7,Fof a woman in North Ayrshire more than
OL,8,F30 years ago.
OL,10,FFraser Kilpatrick allegedly killed
OL,11,FShona Stevens, 31, after striking her
OL,12,Fwith a hammer or similar weapon near
OL,13,Fher home in Irvine in November 1994.
OL,15,FThe 68-year-old, who was charged over
OL,16,Fher death last year, also faces 15
OL,17,Fother charges including the rape of a
OL,18,Fwoman and a young girl between 1986 and
OL,19,F2001.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
