OL,3,GNEWSAMan to stand trial over murder of
OL,4,Awoman in 1994
OL,5,
OL,6,FKilpatrick denies the claims. Lord
OL,7,FArthurson set a date for the trial to
OL,8,Fbegin in January 2028 at the High Court
OL,9,Fin Glasgow.
